##  MODEL CALIBRATION (IMIS — Bayesian)                   ##
##  Parameters: init proportions (F0–F3) + ped_mult_base  ##
##  Targets:    % F3+ at ages 18/25/35;                   ##
##              HCC incidence from F4; DCC rate from F4   ##
